2 CONT Prince Lucien Cardinal Bonaparte
2 CONT Augusta, Princess Gabrielli
2 CONT Prince Roland
2 CONT Princess Jeanne
2 CONT Prince Jerome
2 CONT Prince Charles
2 CONT Napoléon (V) Victor
2 CONT Maria Letizia, Duchess of Aosta
2 CONT Great grandnephews and -nieces
2 CONT Princess Marie
2 CONT Princess Marie Clotilde
2 CONT Napoléon (VI) Louis
2 CONT Great great grandnephews and -nieces
2 CONT Napoléon (VII) Charles
2 CONT Princess Catherine
2 CONT Princess Laure
2 CONT Prince Jérôme
